# One pass along the tab bar. The cheapest way to see chrome changes on every screen at once.
#
# `config` and `stats` are what make it a pass over a working client rather than over a client
# waiting to hear back: without them Settings is a column of "not loaded" and the Status tab's
# Mesh card has no counters and no airtime bar.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 220
config
stats

hold 500
tab nodes
hold 500
tab devices
hold 500
tab status
hold 500
tab settings
hold 900
